WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:05.800
Watch where you step,

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:07.720
people dump bodies out here sometimes.

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:09.780
We are building houses for the poor.

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:12.780
We are now finishing the first 600, but we're going to build 2000.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:15.060
And where does the money come from?

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:17.680
HOLY SHIT!

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:20.540
One kilo is worth 7 thousand dollars here in Columbia,

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:23.140
In the United States, hundred and fifty thousand.

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:25.120
Do the math.

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:29.420
Despite our best efforts, illegal cocaine is coming into our country at alarming levels.

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:33.480
Let's make a deal. You will tell me your secrets and I'll tell you mine.

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:34.740
You two are involved.

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:36.000
Why don't you ask your friends at the CIA?

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:37.300
I will.

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:39.862
You have money, Pablo.

00:00:39.862 --> 00:00:41.540
You have us, what more do you want?

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:42.800
I want respect.

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:44.880
"Long live the mothers of Colombia and the motherland."

00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:47.420
Pablo Escobar Gaviria has been elected

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:50.520
I'm sorry sir but a tie is required to enter the Chamber.

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:52.760
This is a disgrace.

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:56.340
It is an insult to every Colombian.

00:00:58.300 --> 00:00:59.520
It's time to start killing people.

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:01.180
So they learn to respect us.

00:01:01.180 --> 00:01:03.180
In war, you can't win half way.

00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:07.840
The Minister of Justice has been assassinated only minutes ago.

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:12.220
Only one thousand million pesos, only, they're insulting us.

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:14.080
Hand out guns in this land.

00:01:14.780 --> 00:01:17.680
For every dead cop I will pay $2000.

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:20.180
For every captain, $20,000.

00:01:22.280 --> 00:01:24.580
There are 500 men here to capture Pablo Escobar.

00:01:25.660 --> 00:01:27.740
Sir, Escobar! Escobar!

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:29.080
Is he everywhere?

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:31.580
Things are going to get very complicated.

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:34.660
Miss Vallejo, help us find him.

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:45.180
Anybody listening?

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:49.000
Ay, ay, ay, I know that you are all there listening.

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:51.580
Now listen to me malparíos, everyone

00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:54.740
I'm going kill you and your children and your wives

00:01:54.740 --> 00:01:56.680
and you're going to bleed until you die.

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:11.220
Do you still love him?

